{"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/worldmodule\/component"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule"]]},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"topicSections":[{"anchor":"Associated-Types","identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Component\/Required-swift.associatedtype"],"title":"Associated Types","generated":true},{"anchor":"Type-Properties","identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Component\/required-u15k"],"title":"Type Properties","generated":true}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A type that can be stored as a component of an entity."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"protocol"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Component"},{"kind":"text","text":" : "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule6BundleP","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Bundle","text":"Bundle"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule9QueryTermP","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/QueryTerm","text":"QueryTerm"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"where"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"text":" == ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/QueryTerm\/Value","text":"Value","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule9QueryTermP5ValueQa"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule6BundleP4BodyQa","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Bundle\/Body-swift.associatedtype","text":"Body"},{"kind":"text","text":" == "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s5NeverO","text":"Never"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"overview","text":"Overview","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A component is one piece of an entity’s state, such as its position, its velocity or its","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"health. Components are plain value types; the behavior that acts on them belongs to the code","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"that queries and updates them. An entity holds at most one component of each type.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"To make a type a component, declare its conformance. There are no requirements to implement:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["struct Lifetime: Component { var remaining: Double }","","var world = World()","let spark = world.spawn(Position(x: 0, y: 0), Lifetime(remaining: 0.5))","","world[Lifetime.self, of: spark].remaining -= 0.25","print(world[Lifetime.self, of: spark].remaining)","\/\/ Prints \"0.25\""],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Every component is a "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Bundle","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" of itself, so you can pass one anywhere a bundle is expected,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and a "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/QueryTerm","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" that matches the entities holding it."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Requiring-Other-Components","type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Requiring Other Components"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A component can require others. Spawning an entity with the component, or inserting the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"component into an entity, also inserts each required component the entity doesn’t hold, and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"whatever those components require in turn. List the required components in ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Component\/required-u15k","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":":","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["struct Player: Component {","    static var required: some Bundle {","        Position(x: 0, y: 0)","        Health(current: 100)","    }","}","","var world = World()","let player = world.spawn(Player(), Health(current: 50))","","print(world[Position.self, of: player])","\/\/ Prints \"Position(x: 0.0, y: 0.0)\"","print(world[Health.self, of: player].current)","\/\/ Prints \"50\""]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A component given explicitly, like the health in the example above, is kept: required"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"components fill in only the types the entity doesn’t already hold."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"seeAlsoSections":[{"anchor":"Essentials","title":"Essentials","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Entity","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Resource"]}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Component","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"sections":[],"metadata":{"symbolKind":"protocol","externalID":"s:11WorldModule9ComponentP","modules":[{"name":"WorldModule"}],"title":"Component","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Component"}],"remoteSource":{"fileName":"Component.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/ECS\/blob\/main\/Sources\/WorldModule\/Component.swift#L48"},"roleHeading":"Protocol","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"protocol","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Component"}]},"relationshipsSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModul